  "scrotal": "Relating to the scrotum, the skin sac holding the testes.",
  "superior": "Above, nearer the head.",
  "medial": "Nearer the midline of the body.",
  "inferolateral": "Below and to the side.",
  "musculofascial": "Made of muscle and its covering connective tissue (fascia).",
  "peritoneal sac": "Pouch of peritoneum, the abdominal lining, that pushes out to form the hernia.",
